# Temporary "coming soon" gate.
# Cloudflare evaluates these top-to-bottom and stops at the first match,
# so everything the coming-soon page itself needs must be excluded above
# the catch-all, or it would 302 right along with everything else.
#
# Status 200 = rewrite: serve that content, URL stays put, no redirect issued.
# Status 302 = temporary redirect.
# Destinations must be the clean URL (e.g. /coming-soon/), never a literal
# *.html file path — Cloudflare's asset server auto-strips "index.html" and
# redirects to the directory form, which fights a rule pointing at the file
# and produces its own infinite-loop error at deploy time.

/coming-soon             /coming-soon/             200
/coming-soon/            /coming-soon/             200
/coming-soon/*           /coming-soon/             200

/styles.css              /styles.css               200
/script.js               /script.js                200
/robots.txt              /robots.txt               200
/sitemap.xml             /sitemap.xml              200
/assets/*                /assets/:splat            200

/*                       /coming-soon/              302
